difference between Join and gather :
-----------------------------------

In SAP CPI, "Gather" combines multiple messages into a single message, while "Join" brings together messages
from different routes, acting as a synchronization point. Gather merges the content of incoming messages,
whereas Join ensures all messages are available from specified routes before proceeding, but doesn't modify
the message content itself.

The Gather step merges messages from different routes (into a single message) with the option to define
certain strategies how to combine the initial messages. The Join step is used in combination with the Gather step.
It brings together the messages from different routes, but it does not affect the content of the messages.